            "review_text": "JamilHybee\nLiestal, Switzerland4 contributions\n0\nPretty Good!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nWe were on our way to take a look at the jazz club nearby and stumbled upon this restaurant. I wasn't in the mood for Italian food but we decided nonetheless to give this place (empty at that time) a try. \nThe waiters were friendly, helpful and communication went pretty good (english and french would work). \nI really enjoyed the pizzas we had as well as the wine. \nThe ambience is pretty good. You can sit outside or inside. \nIt is a shame this place is a bit hidden.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 4, 2019",
