            "review_text": "tmh52\nGlasgow63 contributions\n0\nMore people need to find this place!\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nThis very pleasant restaurant is located down a lane at the side of the opera house. We only found it because we were going to the jazz club and it's next door. It was empty and we don't usually like to eat in empty restaurants but it looked nice and we just wanted something simple quite quickly. The pizza was pretty good and we had a delicious orange salad with it. The glass of house wine was the cheapest we'd come across and it was perfectly drinkable.\nRead more\nWritten February 18, 2019",
