            "review_title": "Review at Rome Deli",
            "review_text": "Yujin J\nChicago, Illinois30 contributions\n0\nIt’s a shame there is no zero star\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWe went to the restaurant for NYE before we go to the jazz club next, and had the worst meal ever in my life. It was worse than any other street food vender in Vietnam. We ordered quatro cheese pizza and we got margerita. Well, we tried to understand at this point. And then we waited 30 more minutes to get pasta which never came. And what a surprise, 3 tables who came to the restaurant later than us got their food. We thought that we waited enough so we cancelled our pasta and tried to leave and then realized they were trying to charge us the quatro cheese pizza we never even seen. Ha Ha. So, please visit this restaurant when you want to go through horrible meal experience once in your life. And thank you for ruining my NYE dinner.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2017",
