            "review_title": "Review at Rome Deli",
            "review_text": "Bobby K\n8 contributions\n0\nMy first negative review ever, on any platform\nDec 2017\nWe came on New Year’s Eve. \n\nOrdered our food. \n\nWere given the wrong pizza, ok no problem. \n\n30 minutes into waiting for our pasta dish, other tables that came in after us seem to have all of their food.\n\nIt’s the holiday, they’re busy, ok.\n\nCall over the waiter to ask about the pasta, blows me off.\n\n45 minutes in.\n\nWave down the waiter, ignored.\n\nStood up and asked for my bill, got charged for the extra Pizza.\n\nHad to call over the waiter who ignored us to explain his mistake.\n\nI work in e-commerce, I know how bad leaving a negative feedback is; this is well deserved.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2017",
